model g13_range_key_unasked
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, pre-M1 (#97, chunk 4, #106, P18): codes/m0 written's base with its row rr[3] written rr[4], a key its stepped range 1 .. 9 step 2 lacks, and its one ask taken out: load refuses it, LOAD-KEY, whatever the asks (L §2.5 Keys; E §11: a load refusal outranks REQ-ASK), so the same with an ask no text declares. Held for #106: refcore checks the keys at the first ask"

source card "T's fixture card (invented)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

unit etf_unit "a fund unit"

kind persons

kind gifts: event certain
  leg cash: PLN

place konto[p in persons]: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place fund: holdings etf_unit priced fund_price lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..

input bank: observed

input fund_price[m in months]: num PLN/etf_unit

input rr[k in 1..9 step 2]: money PLN

input amt: money PLN

version card_2026
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  persons + [ana] lives 2026-01-01..
  persons + [ben] lives 2026-01-01..
  amt = 1.00 PLN "the card"
  rr[4] = 2.00 PLN "the card"
  opening[konto[ana]] = 1.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "the card"
  bank[r1] = (on: 2026-02-01, kind: gifts, leg cash from world to konto[ana] amount 1.00 PLN) "a gift"
